etc,

then:

auto-silence for the duration of deploy and 5min after

This is what real observability vendors charge $$$ for.

📡 Phase 5: Alert Routing Logic

Right now webhook templates are “fire when late”. Add routing rules:

Rule	Example
by severity	“Critical → PagerDuty, Normal → Slack”
by day/time	“BN oc → On-Call, daytime → Slack”
by retry count	“After 3 failures, escalate to SMS”
by environment	“Staging alerts → Slack only”

This pairs with “multi-URL webhooks” perfectly.

